WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.460
Sketch board tips: draw diagrams faster.

2
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.884
Shortcuts, snapping, frames and export tricks for the Sketch board.

3
00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:11.403
Try the shortcut trainer right in the post.

4
00:00:14.486 --> 00:00:17.430
Use the number keys. Every drawing tool has a key.

5
00:00:20.413 --> 00:00:24.744
Connect shapes with arrows. Start an arrow on one shape and end it on another.

6
00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:30.330
Snap to the grid. Alt S turns snapping on.

7
00:00:33.313 --> 00:00:39.425
Export what you need. Export the whole board or only the selection as PNG

8
00:00:39.425 --> 00:00:40.011
or SVG.

9
00:00:42.995 --> 00:00:46.098
To try it, open Sketch Whiteboard in OpenFile.

10
00:00:46.098 --> 00:00:49.943
Drop in a file, adjust the settings and press the button.

11
00:00:49.943 --> 00:00:53.384
It all runs on your device, so nothing is uploaded.

12
00:00:56.095 --> 00:00:59.700
Read the full post, with live demos, on the OpenFile blog.
